                                <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved card-icon" style="color: #10b981;"></i>
                                    <h3>Reels & Boost Safe Zone (à¦¬à§à¦¸à§à¦Ÿ à¦¸à§‡à¦« à¦œà§‹à¦¨ à¦—à¦¾à¦‡à¦¡)</h3>
                                </div>
                                <span class="badge" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: #10b981; font-weight:600; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:12px; font-size:11px;">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check"></i> à¦Ÿà§‡à¦•à§à¦¸à¦Ÿ à¦¸à§à¦°à¦•à§à¦·à¦¾
                                </span>
                            </div>
