                                <div class="color-grade-container mt-3" id="color-grade-container" style="display: none;">
                                    <p class="help-text">CSS filter preset-à¦à¦° à¦‰à¦ªà¦°à§‡ à¦†à¦°à¦“ à¦¸à§‚à¦•à§à¦·à§à¦®à¦­à¦¾à¦¬à§‡ rendering pixel-level-à¦ à¦ªà§à¦°à¦¤à¦¿à¦Ÿà¦¿ color channel-à¦à¦° curve à¦•à¦¨à§à¦Ÿà§à¦°à§‹à¦² à¦•à¦°à§à¦¨à¥¤ "Normal" preset à¦¹à¦²à§‡à¦“ à¦à¦Ÿà¦¿ à¦•à¦¾à¦œ à¦•à¦°à¦¬à§‡à¥¤</p>

                                    <!-- Color Scopes: Waveform + RGB Histogram (Phase 11) -->
                                    <div class="color-scopes-wrap mt-3">
