                                            <button type="button" id="broll-end-from-playhead" class="btn btn-outline playhead-capture-btn" title="à¦¬à¦°à§à¦¤à¦®à¦¾à¦¨ à¦ªà§à¦²à§‡à¦¹à§‡à¦¡ à¦¸à¦®à¦¯à¦¼ à¦¬à¦¸à¦¾à¦¨ (Use current playhead time)">
